Rule 8 (1D tensor broadcast capability with multi-dimensional tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ ndim(v_2) = 1 then shape(v_2, 0) = 1 ∨ (∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, 0))
