Rule 12 (Broadcast capability on the trailing dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ ndim(v_2) > 0 then shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) ∨ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) = 1 ∨ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) = 1
>>
Rule 13 (Dimensionality difference limit for broadcasting compatibility)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (ndim(v_1) - ndim(v_2) ≤ 4) ∧ (ndim(v_2) - ndim(v_1) ≤ 4)
